        "TileImage": "$($repository bcdb769b-b7a4-4342-98c8-7d8c5224930d).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, we have been informed that James Carey, a well-known gun dealer is currently residing in Hokkaido.\r\rYou&apos;ve been requested to elimante him and his 2 partners in crime, which are disguised as Bodyguards in Hokkaido.\r\rAs always, we don&apos;t want any possibility to trace it back to us, so you will need to find away to eliminate the targets whithout being spotted or recorded by a camera.\r\rFor this mission, we also don&apos;t want any collateral damage so don&apos;t kill or pacify anyone.\r\rGood Luck 47",
